      "P2 preserves raw sign/digits/Text/Binary/Bool/Null/Parameter syntax. P3 validates i64, even hex, decoded length and empty Utf8 typed NULL. DDL raw lengths remain separate.",
      "All wrapper/name/scalar nodes count toward 8192. Source/AST actual capacity and old/new growth coexistence charge the caller-provided shared session/database ledgers.",
      "Existing splitter SourceBuffer diagnostics are Module::Split; parser uses separate private quota backing with Module::Parse and does not change already verified splitter code."
